      "is_best": true,
      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>Hi ​<user-mention data-id=\"108987\">@Abner</user-mention> ,</p><p>Yes, for LSM6DSOX, the address assignment (DAA or ENTDAA) must be performed with I²C Fast Mode Plus timing. Once the slave is addressed, the I²C slave is disabled and the timing becomes compatible with I3C specifications</p></div>"
